  I don't think you would want to put your po'o there, Luke.  I think
that scopes too widely.  That might imply (for example) the only thing
you did all day was hit John.  You want it after the darxi.  You also
could emphasize the contrast by putting ku'i after the .i (or after
the po'o), but I don't think it's necessary, either.  I feel the po'o
would be plenty fine.

            --gejyspa


